{
  "name": "motion-planning-control",
  "description": "Vehicle motion planning and control from spec intake and read-only logging through bicycle model, path and jerk-limited speed profile, PID, lateral control or MPC, closed-loop simulation, margins, Python or C++ runtime, loop timing, bench test and closed-course run behind a hardware emergency stop.",
  "steps": [
